{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>A serpent of copper.</b> He was not told to make it of copper, but Moses reasoned: the Holy One, blessed be He, calls it נָחָשׁ [serpent] — so I shall make it of נְחֹשֶׁת [copper]. A play on words; נָחָשׁ and נְחֹשֶׁת share the same root (Genesis Rabbah 31)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:11:52.382637929Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}